              "payload": {
                "title": "Why Scar-Revision Pricing Starts With a Consultation",
                "script": "Thinking about scar revision and wondering why pricing starts with a consultation?\n\nScar concerns can differ in characteristics such as size, location, and complexity. Because those details vary from person to person, a single flat price may not reflect what is involved.\n\nA consultation is the time to discuss the individual concern and receive information specific to that visit, including pricing.\n\nWhen you are researching, consider public information a starting point for questions\u2014not an individual quote or recommendation.\n\nThis video is for general informational purposes only and is not medical advice or a treatment recommendation.",
